 "_readme": [
  "Machine-readable half of the frozen setup record. Every value marked",
  "<<UNSET>> is a PHYSICAL OBSERVATION nobody has made yet. Fill a field only",
  "from an actual observation at the bench; never estimate it.",
  "Measured values are strings that CARRY their unit, because the acceptance",
  "criterion is 'stated as a number with units' - '0.02 mm', not '0.02'.",
  "The two derived values (tape_pitch.derived_pitch_mm and",
  "chamber_wall_segment.bend.derived_radius_mm) are computed from the raw",
  "numbers beside them; validate_setup_record.py recomputes both and rejects a",
  "record whose derived value disagrees with its own raw measurement.",
  "Gate: python3 validate_setup_record.py   (exit 0 COMPLETE / 1 INVALID / 2 BLOCKED)"
 ],

